              <h3>What is ethical and unethical conduct?</h3>
<p>A company's values are only as strong as those of it's employees. That's why employees need to take on their company's values making them part of every action and decision. This is particularly important with regards to cyber security. Having cyber security policies are one way of protecting those values and reducing risks, laying out clear ethical guidelines for employees to follow.
The best thing would be if everyone in the company believed in those policies and automatically shared those values without having to refer to guidelines.</p>
<p>Let's have a look at ethical and unethical conduct with regards to cyber security.</p>

